Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:06.60,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,250,520,4000,4800)\pos(640,456)}Episode 29 \N\N\N\N\NRefugees Cross the River
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Han free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.77,0:00:11.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang set Bowang Slope on fire at the start of his career,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:13.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and hurt the morale of the Cao army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:19.25,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Not resigned to failure, Cao Cao ordered Cao Ren to attack Xinye again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:23.60,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Little did he know, that he was falling into Zhuge Liang's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:28.95,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Cao Ren was fortunate enough to make a narrow escape in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.49,0:00:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:39.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,3500,3800)\pos(938.753,464.625)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That Zhuge peasant! How dare he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare my armies, we march to Xinye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:01:00.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,00,550,5600,6000)\pos(896.85,471.443)}Liú Yè \N Styled: Ziyáng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor intends to take Jīng-Xiāng for its masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:01:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So this time, when we enter Xiāngyang, \Nwe must conquer the hearts of the populace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has already led the people into Fancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not summon him to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If Liu Bei does not surrender, let him watch as we win over the people our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If Liu Bei does surrender, we can stabilize the lands of Jing without a single fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.78,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This plan can work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, who can be the envoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My Chancellor, there is one man among our army very close with Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He can be our advocate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is so close with Liu Bei?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:01:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,None other than Xu Shu, Xu Yuanzhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He has not offered a single thought to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we send him away, he will not return!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor does not need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Xu Yuanzhi always cared about his reputation. If he doesn't return, he would be ridiculed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.18,0:02:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether or not he is successful, he will definitely return.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well then. Order Xu Yuanzhi to set out at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:27.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(313.067,492.024)}Xu Shu\NStyled: Yuanzhi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.78,0:02:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi has been sent from the Heavens, just like the sweet rain after a long drought!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.10,0:02:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am delighted from the bottom of my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mister Shuijing has predicted long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.06,0:02:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,, that if you have the Sleeping Dragon, the world is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that it is indeed true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.62,0:02:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Since our last meeting at my hut, you have made me busy day and night!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us, has Cao Cao let you come to persuade my Lord to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.26,0:03:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has sent me to persuade you,\N so that he can win the people's hearts this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Cao Cao has his armies traveling along eight routes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,, and intends to enter by damming the Bai River. I'm afraid Fancheng won't hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must make another plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:30.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,100,550,4600,5000)\pos(307.167,497.991)}Zhuge Liang\NStyled: \NKongming
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat is the first choice of the Thirty-Six Stratagems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.98,0:03:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, I am able to meet you all today, my wish is fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,With two armies fighting, it is wrong to overstay. I will take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you have come, you must not return to that damned place again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, if I don't return, I would be mocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother has passed, and I will carry the pain until my last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, even though I am situated in the Cao camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore to never in my life form a plan or stratagem for Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the Sleeping Dragon's help, what fear could you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:29.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,50,2500,3000)\pos(932.849,482.225)}Liu Bei\NStyled: Xuande
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi, take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi, take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you must abandon Fancheng at once\N and retreat to Xiangyang for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Xinye and Fancheng have been with me so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,how can I part with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, if you take them with you, they will only be a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:26.38,Style Names,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,4500,5000)\pos(296.958,441.468)} Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why not let them run for themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All great accomplishers of old,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,, regarded the common men as the foundation and to be of utmost importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The ruler is worth less than the populace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, you can order someone to tell the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,that they can choose to follow us,\N or to remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be as Strategos says.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:05.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Attention, all ye people! \NThe Cao army is coming to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:07.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Those who wish to follow Lord Liu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- We follow with Lord Liu, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:12.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,must cross the river for refuge in Xiangyang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:15.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cross the river for refuge in Xiangyang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Attention, all ye people,\N the Cao army is coming to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Those who wish to follow Lord Liu must cross the river for refuge in Xiangyang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow Lord Liu to Xiangyang to avoid bloodshed! Move quickly, you all!
