Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:03.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(301.255,349.294)}Xiangyang
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear nephew Liu Cong, please open the city gates quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We are only here to save the people, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, open the city gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear nephew Liu Cong, quickly open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:22.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(407.022,454.344)}Liu Cong
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.66,0:10:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The people are too tired and cannot go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear nephew Liu Cong, please open the gates quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You only need to keep the people, my troops will leave immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5} Lies! Those words cannot be trusted!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:49.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,5000,5500)\pos(842.259,436.217)}Cai Mao\NStyled: Degui
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is sending his army to denounce us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He's using the commoners as a cover! You mustn't fall for this trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Greet him with arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't harm the innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Innocent or not, all is uncertain,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we let them in, it'll bring chaos to Xiangyang again. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitorous bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu is a man of virtue!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:21.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,5100,2000)\pos(902.172,469.126)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He has come to save the people, \Nwhy are you keeping them from the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.98,0:11:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle Liu, lead your troops in to kill the wicked traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan! How dare you rebel! Do you recognize me as Senior General Wen Pin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wen Pin!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to protect the people, but now I'm endangering them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.58,0:12:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't enter Xiangyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, abandon Xiangyang at once and turn to Jiangling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiangling is an important location in Jing Province. Why not rest there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wen Pin! I will spare your life today, we will meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan, don't you flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.86,0:12:49.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,5100,2000)\pos(327.769,471.545)}Wén Pìn\NStyled: Zhòngyè
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:06.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,5100,2000)\pos(373.853,309.545)}Grave of Liu Biao,\NOverseer of Jing Province
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.22,0:13:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have failed to live up to your trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The sin is with me alone, \Nnot with the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray that your spirit in heaven will rescue the people of Jing-Xiang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao's army has occupied Fancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.58,0:13:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're preparing boats and rafts and will soon cross the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:13:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:03.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We are leading tens of thousands of people and can only travel about 10 {\i1}li{\i0} per day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,With such speed, when can we reach Jiangling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If the Cao army catches up, how can we resist them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why don't we temporarily abandon the people and advance ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No, accomplishers of great deeds must have the people as their priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now that the people have joined me, \Nhow can I abandon them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, the army will soon be upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You can send Yunchang and Gongyou,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.42,0:14:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,, towards Jiangxia to ask Liu Qi for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to raise his army and embark to meet us at Jiangling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang, follow his orders and hurry to Jiangxia with Gongyou!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.74,0:14:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:31.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,200,5100,2000)\pos(840.997,471.478)}Xún Yōu\NStyled: Gōngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How many troops, horses, money, and grain are there in Jing Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor, there are 50,000 cavalry,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,150,000 infantry, and 80,000 naval infantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.94,0:15:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the money and grain are at Jiangling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,With the supplies from other places, there are enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to supply Chancellor Cao's victorious army for one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How many warships are there? Who was in command?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There are 7,000 warships of all sizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:13.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhang Yun and I were the commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jing Province has 280,000 troops and cavalry, 7,000 warships,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and the money and grain altogether are just about enough
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to support my army for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,With the strength of such resources,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,why did you generals surrender without a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How can the troops of Jing Province dare to resist Chancellor's mighty army?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your intellect is unmatched in the world, you use the army like a god,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.22,0:17:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you are invincible! \NMy Chancellor, you are, of this age...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, I grant you the title of \N{\i1}Marquis Guardian of the South,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and {\i1}Navy Commander of our warships.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Yun is {\i1}Pacifying Marquis{\i0} and {\i1}Vice Commander of the Naval Force.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must keep the naval force ready, and await for command.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,, Liu Cong, I have already granted you to be the Overseer of Qīng Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you weeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:56.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(276.554,268.636)\fade(255,0,255,0,200,5100,2000)}Lady Cai
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,When we surrendered the city, you promised my son will be the Lord of Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:18:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you sending us, mother and son, off to Qīng Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The battles in Jing Province are far from over, Liu Bei and Liu Qi refuse to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.26,0:18:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If I appointed Liu Cong as the lord of Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,how could he keep his lands under his control?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.18,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is so, I do not wish to become an official!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to guard my parents' native lands. \NPlease allow me to become a commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Qīng Province is near the capital. You can become an official under the imperial court.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You avoid being harmed in Jing-Xiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I did this with you both in mind. Set out at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu Jin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lead fifty soldiers to Lady Cai, Liu Cong, and his party before they reach Qīng Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:18:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Cai Mao and Zhang Yun are lesser men who can only flatter and slander.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They are of reprobate nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why were they granted such high ranks and entrusted with the naval force?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I could not tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's because we men of the north are inexperienced with naval warfare,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,so I must use those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,After they have fulfilled their purpose, \NI have other ways to deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My respects, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All the officers of Xiangyang are here already,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,what made you alone take such time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As an official, I failed to protect my Lord's territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:19:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is ashamed. What face do I have to see anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You are an official of integrity, rarely seen in Jing-Xiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame that you haven't met a worthy master!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wen Pin, I appoint you {\i1}Marquis of the Inner Pass,{\i0} and {\i1}Administrator of Jiangxia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Liu Bei's party is traveling only 10{\i1} li {\i0}a day heading towards Jiangling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Jiangling is a place of import in Jing-Xiang. It is rich in money and grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If Liu Bei guards Jiangling, it would be very hard to dislodge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.30,0:20:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wen Pin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:20:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead your troops towards Jiangling and open up a way for our army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Xu Chu, Zhang He! \N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Liao, Li Dian! Yue Jin! \N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose 5,000 cavalry to advance day and night to catch up to Liu Bei! \N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiahou En!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you as the sword-bearer to carry {\i1}the Blue Pommel{\i0} and follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We are traveling too slowly, what if the Cao army pursues us? How can we resist?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.06,0:22:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang and Gongyou departed for Jiangxia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We have received no news, I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.42,0:22:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that Liu Qi...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.18,0:22:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that I will need to trouble you to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.94,0:22:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved Liu Qi's life once. If he sees you, things will be settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.94,0:22:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I would go there, but what of things here, Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:23:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, with Yide and Zilong, nothing will happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.02,0:23:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Feng!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.62,0:23:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.18,0:23:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead 500 troops to escort the Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Xianhe and Zizhong will protect my Lord here well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.70,0:23:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rest assured, Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.82,0:23:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.18,0:24:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place before us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.34,0:24:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the border with Dangyang county, and that hill is Jingshan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.38,0:24:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass on the orders, we'll station on Jingshan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.78,0:24:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.90,0:24:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, we should not station here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.82,0:24:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao now has Xiangyang and will definitely send troops after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.34,0:24:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We are moving so slowly!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.50,0:24:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stop, I fear that Cao Cao's troops will catch up before daylight!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.06,0:24:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The people and soldiers are tired. How can we keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.54,0:24:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we go on like this and the Cao army comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.94,0:24:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,we will not only fail to protect the people from them, but you will also be in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.02,0:24:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.58,0:24:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord should leave the people and ride quickly to Jiangling!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.18,0:24:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, when the Cao army comes, disaster will fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.86,0:25:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}The people have followed me all the way here from Xinye,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.86,0:25:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,668.182)}and have gone through many hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.86,0:25:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,668.182)}How can I abandon them without regard?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.58,0:25:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,668.182)}Although the situation now is pressing,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.58,0:25:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}I have sworn to share life and death with my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.06,0:25:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,668.182)}We will live and perish together!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.58,0:25:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,668.182)}Don't try to persuade me. Pass on my orders again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.58,0:25:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,668.182)}We will station on Jingshan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.58,0:25:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24} Let the people get a night's worth of rest. We'll be on our way in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.90,0:25:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}Zilong will protect my family \Nand Yide will be our rearguard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.66,0:25:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,668.182)}Let's go, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.22,0:25:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.10,0:26:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, let me carry him for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.54,0:26:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cao army is coming! Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.14,0:26:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cao army is coming! Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.22,0:26:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother, elder brother, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.74,0:27:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cao army is coming from the northwest, run to the east at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.10,0:27:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.34,0:27:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry and follow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.62,0:27:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu! Don't you run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wen Pin! How has Brother Jingsheng ever mistreated you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.98,0:27:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare betray your own lord for glory?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.10,0:27:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Submitting to Cao Cao, now killing your late master's brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.26,0:27:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is your conscience? Have you no shame?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.10,0:27:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Treacherous villain, Zhang Yide from Yan is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.46,0:27:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.54,0:28:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move. Try not to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.70,0:28:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.98,0:28:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The common people, old and young,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.26,0:28:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zilong, Mi Zizhong, Mi Zifang, and Jian Xianhe,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.06,0:28:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,where are they all?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.90,0:28:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, the Cao army had encircled all the commoners, and massacred more than half.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.38,0:28:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know where the others have gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.06,0:29:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred thousand living souls all suffered because of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.94,0:29:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the whereabouts of the people, of families, or the officers is unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.34,0:29:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if one has a heart of stone and mind of iron, how can one not grieve?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.62,0:30:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.82,0:30:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.42,0:30:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.06,0:30:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were to die, what reason do we have to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.74,0:30:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, General Mi is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.74,0:30:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,, My lord, emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.98,0:30:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao Zilong has defected to Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.98,0:30:31.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(990.075,489.749)}Mi Fang
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.10,0:30:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak no nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.82,0:30:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong is an old friend, how could he leave me for Cao Cao?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.74,0:30:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have seen how weak our forces were, \Nso he followed Cao Cao for the riches and honors
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.46,0:30:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.58,0:30:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zilong joined me when I was in misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.74,0:30:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,His heart is of iron and stone,\Nno riches and honors can move him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.74,0:31:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him ride towards the northwest with my own eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.94,0:31:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will seek him later. If I run into him, I shall kill him under my spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.78,0:31:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Third brother, don't be rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.26,0:31:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.10,0:31:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Third brother! Third brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.82,0:31:45.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1011.634,417.374)}Dangyang\N Bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.62,0:31:53.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,668.182)}Elder brother could not be seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.62,0:31:55.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,668.182)}even in such short distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.62,0:32:01.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}Why don't I raise the dust as a tactic to deceive the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.62,0:32:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,668.182)}Soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.18,0:32:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}Go cut down branches \Nand tie them to your horse's tails!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.34,0:32:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,680.455)}Divide into two! One group run west to east!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.86,0:32:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,680.455)}The other run east to west!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.34,0:32:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.24}{\pos(637.338,680.455)}This will raise the dust and look like an ambush!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.38,0:32:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.58,0:32:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, where is the Lord now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.94,0:32:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord is now hiding in the woods over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.42,0:32:41.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you have any news about Zilong?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.82,0:32:49.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(353.769,500.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,310,5900,6200)}Jian Yong\NStyled: Xianhe
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.06,0:32:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for General Zhao, I would have met a violent death.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.46,0:32:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao has gone back to look for the two Ladies and the young Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.02,0:32:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please inform the Lord immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.94,0:32:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You must go yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.82,0:32:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.10,0:33:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.14,0:33:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.74,0:33:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Older brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.10,0:33:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.58,0:33:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Older brother, where is our lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.26,0:33:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In the woods before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.66,0:33:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister-in-law, you must be startled!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.02,0:33:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Third brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.38,0:33:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lady, now that you are with General Zhang,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.34,0:33:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will look for Lady Mi and Adou again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.70,0:34:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Return the sword, that's the Chancellor's precious {\i1}Qinggang Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.38,0:34:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Return the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.14,0:35:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, please save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.90,0:35:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Have any of you seen Lady Mi and the young Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.18,0:35:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady has the infant, but can't walk because she is wounded in her leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.94,0:35:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She is sitting by the broken wall over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.02,0:35:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Head for the east, General Zhang is waiting at the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.42,0:35:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you General Zhao! Thank you for rescuing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.50,0:35:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.02,0:35:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.02,0:36:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady, I have come late and let you suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.82,0:36:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you are here, Adou will live!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.86,0:36:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Have pity that his father has wandered half his life with only him as his flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.82,0:36:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that you can protect Adou.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.58,0:36:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can see his father again, I can die without regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.58,0:36:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Zhao Yun's sin to allow my Lady to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.78,0:36:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take my horse, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.02,0:36:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall fight on foot beside you and ensure that we make it out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.46,0:36:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That cannot happen, how can you go without a horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.46,0:37:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will entrust Adou to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.98,0:37:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I...I am already heavily injured, there would be no regrets if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.38,0:37:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you can carry him onward! I don't want to drag you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.38,0:37:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Mi, if I have found you but cannot protect you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.34,0:37:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,how can I look my lord in the face again?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.50,0:37:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, quick! Go over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.26,0:37:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Mi, please, the troops are near! Please mount the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.64,0:37:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I cannot move and should not be a burden to both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.44,0:37:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, please mount the horse now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.36,0:37:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Adou will be left in your care, General
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.42,0:38:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, quick! Go that way, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.52,0:38:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, please mount the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.34,0:38:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.48,0:38:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady, please mount the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.78,0:38:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.64,0:38:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,General, there is someone here! Quick, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.78,0:39:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.26,0:39:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady, my Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.64,0:40:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.86,0:40:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,

